{"id": 8691, "doi": "10.4038/slja.v30i1.8691", "title": "Anaesthetic Concerns in a Case of Metachromatic Leukodystrophy", "abstract": "<p>A 22 year old male patient with metachromatic leukodystrophy presented in our hospital for multiple teeth extraction under general anaesthesia. Metachromatic leukodystrophy is a rare congenital neurodegenerative disorder which predominantly affect the corticospinal tract. In this case report anaesthetic concerns and our perioperative management are discussed.</p>", "keywords": ["Metachromatic leukodystrophy", "General anaesthesia", "Anaesthetic considerations", "Videolaryngoscope"], "authors": [{"first_name": "Shaji", "last_name": "Mathew", "institution": "Manipal Academy of Higher Education", "country": "IN", "email": "shajimanipal@yahoo.co.in", "orcid": "https://orcid.org/0000-0001-8992-8339"}, {"first_name": "Arun Kumar", "last_name": "Handigodu Duggappa", "institution": "Manipal Academy of Higher Education", "country": "IN", "email": "", "orcid": "https://orcid.org/0000-0003-4383-9511"}, {"first_name": "Jyothi", "last_name": "Biradar", "institution": "Manipal Academy of Higher Education", "country": "IN", "email": "", "orcid": ""}, {"first_name": "Eeshwar Murali", "last_name": "Vaideeshwaran", "institution": "Manipal Academy of Higher Education", "country": "IN", "email": "", "orcid": ""}, {"first_name": "Shiyad", "last_name": "Muhamed", "institution": "Manipal Academy of Higher Education", "country": "IN", "email": "", "orcid": ""}], "section": "Case Reports", "pages": "82-84", "date_published": "2022-06-11T00:00:00+00:00", "date_submitted": "2020-10-02T10:27:40+00:00", "license_name": "CC Attribution 4.0", "license_link": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0", "files": [{"label": "PDF", "language": "en", "url": "https://slja.sljol.info/articles/8691/files/8691-1-36801-1-10-20220610.pdf"}], "references": "", "volume": 30, "number": "1", "year": 2022, "issue_id": 748}